    # game/data/world_events/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_1.rpy:2
    old "Ignore it."
    new "置之不理。"

    # game/data/world_events/nijah_rescue/scr_nijah_rescue_1.rpy:36
    old "You'll be leaving now... or else."
    new "你们最好立刻离开...否则后果自负。"

